      "widgets_values": [
        "Heal / Content-Aware Fill: paint what should go (a mask), get it rebuilt from the rest of the photo.\n\ncontent_aware copies texture and structure from nearby patches (like Photoshop Content-Aware Fill); smooth is a soft colour fill for flat areas. grow covers halos, feather blends the edge, context widens the search. Here: a freckle cluster on the arm and a mole on the cheek."
